    <bpmn:process id="W_W4185" name="W4185. Building Management System (BMS) &amp; IoT Integration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Site opening (VS-37); retrofit; BMS-strategy refresh
Frequency: Per deployment + continuous operation
Volume: ~205 sites × BMS/IoT (HVAC, lighting, energy meters, sensors)
Owner: Facilities Technology Lead / IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113)
Participants: Energy (VS-120), Engineering (VS-20.2), InfoSec (VS-27.3), IT (VS-27)
Source: workflow W4185 — Building Management System (BMS) &amp; IoT Integration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4185_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4185_Lane1" name="Facilities Tech Lead">
