      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4185_Start3" name="Site opening (VS-37); retrofit; BMS-strategy refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4185_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4185_Task4" name="Facilities/IT/EA define the BMS/IoT architecture and standards (controllers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities/IT/EA define the BMS/IoT architecture and standards (controllers, protocols, IoT sensors, central monitoring) for stores/DCs/HQ, integrated with the energy program (VS-120)
Responsible (R): Facilities Tech Lead / IT / EA
Accountable (A): CIO / Head of Facilities
Duration: Per strategy</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4185_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4185_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4185_Task5" name="Facilities/IT deploy the BMS at sites (HVAC/lighting/meter control…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities/IT deploy the BMS at sites (HVAC/lighting/meter control, environmental sensors), connect to central monitoring, and secure it (OT security links to VS-27.3)
Responsible (R): Facilities Tech Lead / IT / Provider
Accountable (A): Facilities Tech Lead
Duration: Per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4185_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4185_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4185_Task6" name="Facilities/Energy operate the BMS (monitoring, alarms, control), integrate data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities/Energy operate the BMS (monitoring, alarms, control), integrate data into analytics (VS-28/VS-120), and maintain the platform lifecycle (W4168-style governance)
Responsible (R): Facilities Tech Lead / Energy Officer
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4185_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4185_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4185_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4185_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-646 (ensure controlled execution — Building Automation, Energy Control &amp; Facilities Analytics (PA-138.3).) | - CTL-646: BMS OT-security assessed/segmented (VS-27.3); platform governed (VS-113)
Owner: Facilities Technology Lead / IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
