    <bpmn:process id="W_W4186" name="W4186. HVAC, Lighting &amp; Environmental Control Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Energy-efficiency program (VS-120); comfort complaint; optimization cycle
Frequency: Continuous optimization + seasonal tuning
Volume: ~205 sites × HVAC/lighting control (largest energy load)
Owner: Facilities Tech Lead / Energy Officer (VS-120)
Participants: Energy (VS-120), Store Ops (VS-07), Engineering (VS-20.2), Comfort/VOC (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4186 — HVAC, Lighting &amp; Environmental Control Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4186_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4186_Lane1" name="Facilities Tech Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4186_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4186_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4186_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4186_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4186_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4186_Start3" name="Energy-efficiency program (VS-120); comfort complaint; optimization cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4186_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4186_Task4" name="Facilities/Energy optimize HVAC/lighting schedules and set-points via the BMS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities/Energy optimize HVAC/lighting schedules and set-points via the BMS (occupancy-aware, time-of-day, tropical-climate tuning), aligned to the energy-conservation plan (VS-120.2)
Responsible (R): Facilities Tech Lead / Energy Officer
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities / Energy Officer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4186_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4186_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4186_Task5" name="Facilities/Store Ops balance comfort vs efficiency (customer/staff comfort…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities/Store Ops balance comfort vs efficiency (customer/staff comfort links to VS-13 VOC, VS-83 wellness), and tune environmental control (humidity, ventilation) for tropical conditions
Responsible (R): Facilities Tech Lead / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Seasonal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4186_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4186_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4186_Task6" name="Facilities/Energy measure HVAC/lighting energy savings vs baseline (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities/Energy measure HVAC/lighting energy savings vs baseline (links to VS-120 M&amp;V W3747), report to EEC governance (VS-120), and feed into decarbonization (VS-25)
Responsible (R): Facilities Tech Lead / Energy Officer
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4186_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4186_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4186_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4186_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-139 (ensure facilities compliance &amp; vendor performance.) | - CTL-646: HVAC/lighting optimization balanced with comfort (VOC); savings measured (VS-120 M&amp;V)
Owner: Facilities Tech Lead / Energy Officer (VS-120)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
