    <bpmn:process id="W_W4187" name="W4187. Space Management, Occupancy &amp; Utilization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Space review; expansion/remodel; utilization data
Frequency: Periodic review + on change
Volume: HQ (~3,000 sqm) + DC office space + back-office
Owner: Facilities Workplace-Services Lead / Real Estate (VS-97)
Participants: Real Estate (VS-97), Store Ops (VS-07), PMO (VS-112), IT (VS-99)
Source: workflow W4187 — Space Management, Occupancy &amp; Utilization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4187_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4187_Lane1" name="Facilities Workplace-Services Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4187_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4187_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4187_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4187_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4187_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4187_Start3" name="Space review; expansion/remodel; utilization data">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4187_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4187_Task4" name="Facilities maintain the space/occupancy register (HQ/DC office, workstations…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities maintain the space/occupancy register (HQ/DC office, workstations, meeting rooms, storage) integrated with real estate (VS-97) and plan-vs-actual utilization
Responsible (R): Facilities Workplace-Services Lead / Real Estate
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4187_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4187_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4187_Task5" name="Facilities measure space utilization (occupancy sensors, desk/room booking…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities measure space utilization (occupancy sensors, desk/room booking links to VS-27), identify under/over-utilized space, and recommend reconfiguration/consolidation
Responsible (R): Facilities Workplace-Services Lead / IT
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4187_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4187_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4187_Task6" name="Facilities execute space changes (reconfig, moves links to VS-99 IT equipment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities execute space changes (reconfig, moves links to VS-99 IT equipment moves, remodel links to VS-109), and report utilization/savings (W4192)
Responsible (R): Facilities Workplace-Services Lead / PMO
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4187_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4187_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4187_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
