    <bpmn:process id="W_W4188" name="W4188. Facilities Sustainability &amp; Green-Building Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sustainability strategy (VS-25); green-building target; certification cycle
Frequency: Continuous + certification cycle
Volume: ~205 sites (green operations, water, waste, materials, IEQ)
Owner: Facilities Sustainability Lead / ESG (VS-25)
Participants: ESG (VS-25), Energy (VS-120), Waste (VS-73), Green-Building Advisory (VS-78), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W4188 — Facilities Sustainability &amp; Green-Building Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4188_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4188_Lane1" name="Facilities Sustainability Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4188_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4188_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4188_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4188_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4188_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4188_Start3" name="Sustainability strategy (VS-25); green-building target; certification cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4188_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4188_Task4" name="Facilities/ESG define green-building operations standards (water efficiency…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities/ESG define green-building operations standards (water efficiency, waste diversion, sustainable materials, indoor environmental quality) aligned to ESG (VS-25) and green-building advisory (VS-78)
Responsible (R): Facilities Sustainability Lead / ESG
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4188_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4188_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4188_Task5" name="Facilities operate green programs (water recycling, LED retrofits, waste…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities operate green programs (water recycling, LED retrofits, waste diversion links to VS-73, low-VOC materials, IEQ monitoring) and pursue/retain certification (BERDE/LEED EBOM where applicable)
Responsible (R): Facilities Sustainability Lead / Providers
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4188_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4188_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4188_Task6" name="Facilities/ESG measure sustainability performance (water/waste/materials/IEQ…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities/ESG measure sustainability performance (water/waste/materials/IEQ KPIs), report to ESG (VS-25.1/VS-25.3), and support green-building advisory (VS-78) for clients
Responsible (R): Facilities Sustainability Lead / ESG
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4188_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
