Frequency: Per site (10–15 openings/yr + closures)
Volume: Per site lifecycle event
Owner: Facilities Project Lead / Store Opening (VS-37)
Participants: Store Opening (VS-37), Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), Engineering (VS-20.2), IT (VS-99), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W4190 — Site Opening/Closing Facilities Handover</bpmn:documentation>
