      <bpmn:userTask id="W4190_Task5" name="Facilities commission building systems at handover (HVAC, fire/life-safety…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities commission building systems at handover (HVAC, fire/life-safety, electrical, plumbing, BMS, elevators) and verify against design/spec, coordinating with construction (VS-20.2) and store opening (VS-37)
Responsible (R): Facilities Project Lead / Engineering
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Per opening</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4190_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4190_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4190_Task6" name="Facilities onboard services (cleaning, pest, guarding, grounds, waste…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities onboard services (cleaning, pest, guarding, grounds, waste, utilities) to the new site per the service catalog (W4171), and obtain fire-safety/occupancy permits (VS-22.1)
Responsible (R): Facilities Soft/Hard-Services Lead / Compliance
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Per opening</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4190_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4190_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4190_Task7" name="Facilities/Store Opening hand over to site ops (O&amp;M manuals, warranties, BMS…">
