    <bpmn:process id="W_W4191" name="W4191. Facilities Business Continuity &amp; Critical-Systems Resilience" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: BCP cycle (VS-26); disaster (VS-69); critical-system failure
Frequency: Annual BCP + reactive
Volume: ~205 sites × critical systems (power, fire, security, HVAC, water)
Owner: Facilities Maintenance Lead / BCP (VS-26)
Participants: BCP (VS-26), HSE (VS-24.2), IT (VS-27), LP (VS-23), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4191 — Facilities Business Continuity &amp; Critical-Systems Resilience</bpmn:documentation>
