    <bpmn:process id="W_W4192" name="W4192. Facilities Performance Analytics &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly review; OpEx cycle; benchmark refresh
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Enterprise facilities KPIs across ~205 sites
Owner: Head of Facilities / Analytics (VS-28) / OpEx (VS-133)
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Finance (VS-17.4), OpEx (VS-133), Store Ops (VS-07), Providers
Source: workflow W4192 — Facilities Performance Analytics &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4192_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4192_Lane1" name="Head of Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4192_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4192_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4192_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4192_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4192_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4192_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly review; OpEx cycle; benchmark refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4192_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4192_Task4" name="Facilities/Analytics measure facilities KPIs — SLA adherence (W4171)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities/Analytics measure facilities KPIs — SLA adherence (W4171), PM-vs-reactive ratio (W4173/W4174), cost-to-serve (W4176), uptime, energy (VS-120), customer/employee satisfaction (VS-13/VS-103.2)
Responsible (R): Head of Facilities / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4192_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4192_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4192_Task5" name="Facilities/OpEx identify improvement opportunities (recurring issues, cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities/OpEx identify improvement opportunities (recurring issues, cost leakage, process variants) via analytics/process mining (VS-133), and prioritize with benefit modeling
Responsible (R): Head of Facilities / OpEx
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4192_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4192_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4192_Task6" name="Facilities execute improvement projects (links to VS-133/VS-112), track benefit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities execute improvement projects (links to VS-133/VS-112), track benefit realization (VS-133 W4065), and benchmark facilities cost-to-serve vs retail norms
Responsible (R): Head of Facilities / Finance / OpEx
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4192_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4192_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4192_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4192_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-646 (ensure controlled execution — Building Automation, Energy Control &amp; Facilities Analytics (PA-138.3).) | - CTL-646: facilities KPIs reviewed monthly; improvements benefit-tracked (VS-133); cost-to-serve benchmarked
Owner: Head of Facilities / Analytics (VS-28) / OpEx (VS-133)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
